<title>JAPAN: Japan rubber stocks down at end of February.</title>
<headline>Japan rubber stocks down at end of February.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-February rubber stock figures, issued by the Japan Rubber Trade Association, with month-earlier and year-earlier comparisons, in tonnes, were as follows:</p>
<p>    Month	    Feb 97   Jan 97   Feb 96</p>
<p>    Stocks	   41,311   41,599   39,924</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks, in tonnes</p>
<p>    Crude rubber   35,426   35,607   33,572</p>
<p>    Synthetic	 5,701    5,846    6,250</p>
<p>    Latex		 184	147	102</p>
</text>
